@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

rectangle "CameraX" as Camera
rectangle "Frame Scheduler" as Scheduler
rectangle "MediaPipe Pose" as Pose
rectangle "Coordinate Normalizer" as Normalize
rectangle "Landmark Smoother" as Smooth
rectangle "Tracking Quality Gate" as Gate
rectangle "Exercise Analyzer" as Analyzer
rectangle "Biomechanics Metrics" as Metrics
rectangle "Deterministic Rules" as Rules
rectangle "Cue Arbitrator" as Cue
rectangle "Overlay / TTS" as Output
queue "Telemetry Buffer\nbounded / non-blocking" as Buffer
rectangle "Batch Writer" as Writer
database "Room / SQLite" as Room

Camera --> Scheduler : frame + monotonic timestamp
Scheduler --> Pose : newest eligible frame only
Pose --> Normalize : landmarks + visibility/presence
Normalize --> Smooth : canonical L/R + coordinate space
Smooth --> Gate : MovementFrame
Gate --> Analyzer : valid tracking only
Gate --> Output : setup/tracking guidance
Analyzer --> Metrics : phase + temporal state
Metrics --> Rules : metrics + confidence
Rules --> Cue : candidate FormEvents
Cue --> Output : one prioritized actionable cue

Analyzer --> Buffer : telemetry / rep transitions
Metrics --> Buffer : metrics / compact trace points
Rules --> Buffer : evidence / FormEvents
Buffer --> Writer : asynchronous bounded batches
Writer --> Room : transactions

note bottom of Scheduler
Backpressure rule:
never build an unbounded frame queue.
Drop stale frames to protect latency.
end note

note bottom of Normalize
Normalize rotation, mirroring, coordinate spaces,
body side labels, timestamps and units
before exercise-specific reasoning.
end note

note bottom of Gate
Reject analysis when required landmarks are missing,
tracking confidence is low, camera view is unsuitable,
or temporal discontinuity is detected.
end note

note bottom of Cue
Policy considers severity, actionability, persistence,
priority, cooldown, repeated cues, and per-rep/set limits.
end note

note bottom of Buffer
Storage is outside the realtime critical path.
If the buffer is under pressure, discard oldest/raw telemetry first.
Durable rep summaries, metrics and FormEvents have higher priority.
Never stall live coaching waiting for Room.
end note

@enduml
